{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bupsya is a desktop sticker featuring a fun mini-game. It acts like a platformer character, hopping across your open windows as it chases the cursor, yet never quite reaching it. What could it be feeling towards the cursor?<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609150/extras/ezgif-2ec7ce0383d2e4.gif?t=1743816029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Bupsya escape from Gun Gurda, a system that has mistakenly identified Bupsya as a virus. Arrange your windows strategically to help Bupsya evade Gun Gurda's deadly attacks. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609150/extras/ezgif-4d035da5787306.gif?t=1743816029\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up the application in the system tray. <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609150?t=1743816029","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609150?t=1743816029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609150/d840b0bad8e8223208987f4130359be762e23e23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743816029","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609150/d840b0bad8e8223208987f4130359be762e23e23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743816029","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bupsya is a desktop sticker featuring a fun mini-game. It acts like a platformer character, hopping across your open windows as it chases the cursor, yet never quite reaching it. What could it be feeling towards the cursor?<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a